# ScholarPath — Phase 3 Rules

## Scope Guard

Phase 3 — AI Workflow Layer. Build:
- Motivation letter generator (Claude + template fallback)
- Application workflow UI (`/applications/[id]`)
- Draft saving and editing
- Letters linked to applications via `motivationLetter` field

Do NOT implement yet:
- Email or in-app notifications (Phase 4)
- Community, scraping, career module (Phase 5)

## AI Constraints

- AI generates content only — backend persists to DB
- User initiates generation (`POST /applications/:id/generate-letter`)
- User controls status transitions
- Require motivation letter before SUBMITTED status

## Exit Criteria

- Users generate and edit full motivation letters
- Letters are attached to applications
